     3	Terms used on this page: a *measurement window* is one uninterrupted,
     4	calibrated collection session; a *pack* is the frozen campaign plan and its
     5	authenticated supporting files; a *detection floor* is the largest false
     6	difference the admitted measurement system can produce; a *mint* is the
     7	governed process that issues a floor artifact; an *arm* is one pre-registered
     8	workload or comparison track; a *verdict* is the final governed decision to
     9	admit or refuse evidence; and a *refusal* is a recorded decision not to issue a
    10	result when a required gate or piece of evidence fails.
