   114	the run-book: issue, or mint, the governed drift-bound artifact inside the window, then collect a start
   115	triplet, midpoint reference, and end triplet around the science members. That
   116	protocol ran five times and passed five times — windows C, D, a10, the 7B
   117	floor window, and the contrast window — under the merged screening and
   118	uncertainty-budget rules (D-078 clause 10). One record-keeping caveat: for
   119	a10 (and its reference window a9) the machine-readable verdict files were
