   149	preserves the original figures as historical evidence only; D-078 bars their
   150	quotation or claim use.
   151	
   152	Remaining backends plug into the same adapter interfaces: the fixture-first
   153	2K NVIDIA stack (SSH transport, node worker, nvidia-smi + vLLM adapters)
   154	includes NV-GATE-2 software hardening: per-backend raw-lineage verifier
   155	registration, usage-first vLLM streaming, and identity-aware process-survival
   156	handling. The NV-5 localhost lead gate passed 3/3, but ALL remote protocol
   157	pins remain PROVISIONAL pending first live hardware contact; Jetson Orin (2L)
   158	remains gated on device access.
   159	
