   161	production-uncertainty path, the campaign-verdict split, idle-dependence/HAC
   162	uncertainty, the inter-token metric, doctor preflight, and the contrast/claim
   163	engine. The analysis trio—manifest, verdict split, and contrast/claim
   164	engine—is complete. The six frozen legacy arms, meaning the pre-registered
   165	workload tracks, and 0.3.x/0.4.x dispatch rules
