   181	The repository currently contains:
   182	
   183	- Typed config and output schemas with JSON-Schema export and validation.
   184	- Runtime, telemetry, and transport interface contracts, with shipped mock
   185	  adapters and a backend registry.
   186	- The runnable harness: bundle writer, controller lifecycle, reducer, a
