   213	## Run The Harness (mock target — no hardware or extras needed)
   214	
   215	```bash
   216	# Produce a complete run bundle from the mock target (deterministic):
   217	python3 -m joulewise run configs/examples/mock_local.json --runs-dir runs
   218	
   219	# Structurally verify any bundle:
