   228	
   229	A run bundle (`runs/<run_id>/`) contains the normalized `config.json`,
   230	`metadata.json`, the `events.jsonl` lifecycle/phase/token log, the raw
   231	`power_trace.csv`, model outputs, per-component logs, and the reduced
   232	`summary_metrics.json` (written last; its presence marks a complete bundle).
