   234	Bundles are immutable evidence: re-running the same config into the same
   235	`--runs-dir` fails by design with a run-ID collision (D-010/D-022). To rerun
   236	a member, move the old bundle aside, change `run_id`, or use a fresh runs
   237	dir; collisions are refusals, not bugs.
