    13	The registry/bank status is copied, not reconsidered: **promoted** means the question owns a named project slot; **banked** means viable but not promoted; **candidate** means proposed and bounded; **killed** means deliberately rejected; **answered-L1** means answered only at the registry’s limited descriptive claim level; and **candidate (C-023)** is the whole-project review’s candidate class.
