    24	- **H. `answerable by the _v6 scored leg`** — Ed’s scored benchmark leg uses GSM8K, eight items per member, and a pinned checker; accuracy is a set property under the AP-5 / C5-1.9 quarantine because training-data contamination cannot be ruled out. It is built at the desk during `_v5` and run post-campaign after the fiducial night (`docs/decision_log.md:193`).
