   138	# Freeze-neutral serialized status for successor (_v2 and later) packs.
   139	#
   140	# Cold-gate verdict of 2026-08-18 (composed; adopts option (a) as narrowed and
   141	# option (d) as a gate condition -- holdings 1 and 6): the committed D-134
   142	# freeze receipt plus its plan-tree attachment IS the draft->frozen transition,
   143	# and the receipt's pack_identity pins calibration_plan.json -- which carries a
   144	# serialized status site -- by SHA. A post-mint serialized transition therefore
   145	# invalidates the receipt at the dry-run/arm/verify gates, and no re-mint path
   146	# exists. Every status-bearing byte a successor pack emits must consequently be
   147	# true on BOTH sides of the receipt: it states when the bytes were generated,
   148	# never that the pack is unfrozen or unarmable. The dynamic authority remains
   149	# GenerationIdentity.target_status, read from the authenticated attachment.
