    95	   rehearsal arm and the consuming arm (`joulewise/arm_readiness.py:11721-11752`;
    96	   arm call at `:8137-8142`). This is the real-pack re-cut of #225's B9
    97	   disclosure: unlike the discarded diagnostic pack, this pack is supposed to
    98	   traverse the publication gate; no admission exception is needed, and the
    99	   estate-11 transaction has produced the marker. A missing out-of-band digest
   100	   refuses `confirmation_missing` before table semantics are trusted
   101	   (`:11376-11416`). `generate_arm_readiness.py arm` and `verify` accept only
   102	   `--expected-confirmation-digest`; they resolve the table implicitly from
