   522	2. generate all three real `_v5` packs and their exact freeze/mint supply; and
   523	3. run estate 12 through reviewed freeze, re-attestation, and green receipts.
   524	
   525	No G2-b T-0 receipt may predate this refreshed reviewed head.
   526	
   527	## G2-b — evening before the transaction, real-pack one-block proof
   528	
   529	The pack-existence gate begins here, and nowhere in G2-a. G2-b uses the real
   530	estate-12 `_v5` pack, its own non-claim runs root, the one-block proof, the
   531	ratified post-bracket physical-ahead boundary, and exact finalize-refusal
   532	equality.
   533	
   534	### Phase A — desk preflight
   535	
   536	### A1 — fixed supply and checkout inspection (MAGISTRATE)
   537	
   538	CWD: `$MEASUREMENT_CHECKOUT`. Timing: <2 min. Expected artifact: transcript
   539	only. Expected refusal: any absent pack/file, non-main head, dirty governed
   540	path, unresolved floor path, or B10 refusal.
   541	
