   571	
   572	### A2 — stage the complete finalizer input tree in custody (MAGISTRATE)
   573	
   574	CWD: `$MEASUREMENT_CHECKOUT`. Timing: <2 min before launch, then <1 min after
   575	the post bracket. Expected artifacts: a byte-identical complete pack subtree,
   576	floor, completed ledger, and adjacent head pin. Expected refusal: any recursive
