The campaign design is substantially stronger than the frozen prose: the generator pre-registers a twofold ratio per component, refuses zero denominators, and requires a shared-error replay for every comparative cell. The paper problem is now one of scientific interpretation and last-mile execution: the ratio is a defensible operational falsifier, but it is not a significance test and it cannot validate pulse-to-inference transfer.
