   182	
   183	The reviewer's estimate was right in magnitude. The correction moves the
   184	published-style bound by well under half a percent at the median, and never by
   185	more than 4.05 % or 1.1 ms on any capture it admits. It moves the bound in both
   186	directions, so it is not a uniform inflation or a uniform shrinkage.
